What is DIY Home Improvement?
DIY Home Improvement refers to homeowners’ engagement in performing repair, remodeling, and beautification tasks on their own feet, without hiring professional contractors. The range of activities includes wall painting, flooring installation, kitchen remodels, bathroom upgrades, landscaping, and the acquisition of tools and materials.
